{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「Nintendo GameCube Nintendo Classics」新增「水上摩托 藍色風暴」！騎乘水上摩托車奔馳於隨天氣變化的波浪上\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4d08c0b64fdeaf4943b38b41e49a073e079522570f30698baea30a55e673cb1b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdbd5f776ff130514ca9f1a4cb46f2105.jpg_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「Nintendo GameCube Nintendo Classics」新增「水上摩托 藍色風暴」！騎乘水上摩托車奔馳於隨天氣變化的波浪上</figcaption></figure><p>任天堂於「<strong>Nintendo GameCube Nintendo Classics</strong>」新增了「<strong>水上摩托 藍色風暴</strong>」。<br/>「Nintendo GameCube Nintendo Classics」可透過加入「Nintendo Switch Online + 追加包」來遊玩。</p><h2>「Nintendo GameCube Nintendo Classics」新增「水上摩托 藍色風暴」！</h2><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>「水上摩托 藍色風暴」是2001年發售的Nintendo GameCube專用競速遊戲。<br/>可以騎乘<strong>水上摩托車</strong>與對手競爭速度與技術，或是挑戰自己的紀錄。</p><p></p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/nintendo-classics-wave-race-blue-storm-01.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5c3dd7d614e6981fb59de9bff16c3818d0d793a3f778db6e83fe28da5ab5b234/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F084d8ea978904be5dd4f274f9334f83c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/nintendo-classics-wave-race-blue-storm-02.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f68fceb3799df4285dba42a5ef4e543c2339e5c997dd42980284a1a891ae317e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7643fe303ea86385fb0aff7f9aad0333.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/nintendo-classics-wave-race-blue-storm-03.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/304226ca0ec4250d63faa240cca1ff70dab0c51b31682ed6d8e4cbd80ef7814f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc580d403e97db1199428c1a305410875.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/nintendo-classics-wave-race-blue-storm-04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b7e05bdeee77b5829f0194f62291de1466a3cb1e1fa2ee3fcec2fefc9f637243/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F667806a22f54d2011ccb8fe189f0c26f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>本作的特徵是 天氣會影響視野、水位與波浪高度 。<br/>從平穩的晴天到下雨並湧起大浪的暴風雨中，能豪邁地奔馳於真實變化的水面上。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><h3>專用控制器也販售中</h3><figure><img alt=\"Nintendo GameCube 控制器\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/548d915e7b47de4e3c12b847409032d9987a27dfdf1b069cc03d8f7fd0cb5731/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F094f98b2e24b1b52ec3a3f7c187322e2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Nintendo GameCube 控制器</figcaption></figure><p>能享受GameCube原有操作感的<a href=\"https://store-jp.nintendo.com/item/hardware-accessory/VM_BEE_A_LRDUA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nintendo GameCube 控制器</a>也以 「Nintendo Switch Online」加入者限定商品 販售中。<br/>除了可無線連接外，也搭載了能立即存取遊戲聊天的「<strong>C按鈕</strong>」。</p><p>「Nintendo GameCube Nintendo Classics」僅能在Nintendo Switch 2上遊玩。<br/>除了「水上摩托 藍色風暴」之外，還能遊玩「超級瑪利歐陽光」、「薩爾達傳說 風之律動」、「火焰之紋章：蒼炎之軌跡」等作品。</p><p>詳細內容請參閱<a href=\"https://www.nintendo.com/jp/topics/article/8cf1e987-b681-4b53-a68e-483b8d455ee7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nintendo Topics</a>。</p><blockquote><p></p><p>[トピックス]【11月24日追加】「ニンテンドー ゲームキューブ Nintendo Classics」に『ウェーブレース ブルーストーム』を追加。<a href=\"https://t.co/ENBjOoTiIP\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/ENBjOoTiIP</a></p><p>— 任天堂株式会社 (@Nintendo) <a href=\"https://x.com/Nintendo/status/2125035363144282574?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 24, 2026</a></p></blockquote><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/tet-1-cup-58th-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸第58回TETRIS 1王者盃「皮克敏4 當多慮檢定 合作祭！」於11月27日起舉行！可以獲得皮克敏活動特別主題</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/hori-starlightnight-switch2-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸Nintendo Switch 2 專用「月亮伊布＆太陽伊布 Starlight Night」系列登場！推出控制器與收納包</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/nintendo-switch2-sumikkogurashi/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸Nintendo Switch 2「角落小夥伴 歡迎來到暖呼呼溫泉」發售！「角落小夥伴」遊戲系列最新作</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/karaoke-joysound-for-nintendo-switch-update-nov2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「卡拉OK JOYSOUND for Nintendo Switch」支援Switch 2內建麥克風！不必另購麥克風也能輕鬆歡唱</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/splatoon3-update-ver12-0-0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「斯普拉遁3」更新資料Ver.12.0.0開始發布！可獲得大量道具的遊戲新聞也同步發布</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:03:54.651325+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1121,"images":6,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:30.350943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:57:30.058213+00:00","content_hash":"5747cee87a36f9311a4d7d597a6e363f08d40cc621c6a1f8b15cb409ada15a8e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}